{
  "iri": "http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/CHEBI_85979",
  "lang": "en",
  "description": [
    "A 1,3-thiazole that is butan-2-ol which is substituted at positions 1, 2, and 3 by 1,2,4-triazol-1-yl, 2,5-difluorophenyl, and 4-(<em>p</em>-cyanophenyl)-1,3-thiazol-2-yl groups, respectively. It is an antifungal drug used for the treatment of invasive aspergillosis and invasive mucormycosis."
